---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Fun Stuff | Jasmer's Corner" description="Technical corners: probability, competitive programming, and aviation.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Fun Stuff</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none mb-12 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        This section contains various interests and hobbies that intrigue me beyond my core research work. 
        Here you'll find probability puzzles I solve for fun, competitive programming solutions, and my 
        passion for aviation. These corners represent the diverse technical curiosities that keep me 
        engaged and learning.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
        As an aviation enthusiast, I track airlines flown, aircraft types experienced, and maintain 
        my Infinite Flight stats. The probability corner features mathematical puzzles that challenge 
        intuition and require careful reasoning. The competitive programming sections document solutions 
        to problems from USACO and CSES, capturing key algorithmic insights along the way.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <a
        href="/fun/probability"
        class="p-6 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-600 transition-colors"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          Probability Corner
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Mathematical probability problems with detailed solutions. Markov chains, information theory, stochastic processes.
        </p>
      </a>
      
      <a
        href="/fun/usaco"
        class="p-6 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-600 transition-colors"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          USACO / Competitive Programming
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Competitive programming solutions and key insights. USACO problems, algorithms, and data structures.
        </p>
      </a>
      
      <a
        href="/fun/cses"
        class="p-6 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-600 transition-colors"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          CSES Problem Set
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Solutions to problems from the CSES Problem Set. Algorithms, data structures, and competitive programming.
        </p>
      </a>
      
      <a
        href="/fun/aviation"
        class="p-6 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-600 transition-colors"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          Aviation Corner
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Airlines flown, aircraft types, and Infinite Flight stats.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

